#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/layers.rst:5
msgid "Layers in element editor"
msgstr "元素编辑器中的图层"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/layers.rst:7
msgid ""
"Overlapping of parts, graphical elements, may occur at the graphical "
"representation of elements. QElectroTech allows defining the representation "
"order from part. Working with layers will be necessary, for example, when a "
"filled part as `rectangle`_ or `ellipse`_ hides a `text`_."
msgstr ""
"在元素的图形化表达方式中可能会发生部分重叠，图形元素的重叠。QElectroTech允许从部分定义表达顺序。需要用层来工作，例如当一个填充的部分作为 "
"`矩形 <rectangle_>`_ 或 `椭圆 <ellipse_>`_ 隐藏一个 `文本 <text_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/layers.rst:11
msgid ""
"The definition of layer level from each `part`_ can only be done from `menu "
"bar`_."
msgstr "从每个 `部件 <part_>`_ 对图层级别的定义只能从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 完成。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/layers.rst:13
msgid "Select the `part`_ which layer level should be defined."
msgstr "选择应当定义的 `部件 <part_>`_ 层级 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/layers.rst:14
msgid "Select **Edit** from the main bar and the desired layer action."
msgstr "从主栏和想要的层动作中选择 **Edit** 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/graphic/layers.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit Menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器编辑菜单"

